sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI Agent
    participant FastMCP as FastMCP (server.py)
    participant Tool as query_passengers (query.py)
    participant DB as database.py
    participant SQLite as SQLite DB

    Agent->>FastMCP: JSON-RPC tools/call<br/>{"name": "query_passengers",<br/>"arguments": {"filters": {"sex": "female"}}}

    FastMCP->>Tool: query_passengers(filters={"sex": "female"})
    Tool->>Tool: Start timer (time.monotonic)

    Tool->>DB: query_resolved(filters={"sex": "female"})

    DB->>DB: Resolve filters via FILTER_CONDITIONS<br/>"sex" → "s.sex = ?" param: "female"

    DB->>DB: Build SQL:<br/>RESOLVED_VIEW_SQL<br/>+ WHERE s.sex = ?<br/>+ LIMIT 50

    DB->>SQLite: Execute parameterized query<br/>Params: ["female", 50, 0]

    SQLite-->>DB: Rows with resolved labels

    DB-->>Tool: List of dicts<br/>[{"sex": "female", "class": "First", ...}]

    Tool->>Tool: Log: tool.query_passengers,<br/>row_count=314, duration_ms=0.82

    Tool-->>FastMCP: JSON string:<br/>{"rows": [...], "count": 314}

    FastMCP-->>Agent: JSON-RPC response<br/>{"result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "..."}]}}
